        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The smartphone has a processing unit, flash storage, RAM, and other connectivity features for standard smartphones.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset focuses on the average hi-tech smartphones with 4 - 6.5 inch screen size. The weight of the smartphone is defined to be about 160 grams. The data for average smartphones are mainly taken from the JRC technical report and other published articles. The modeled smartphone has a flash storage capacity of 32 GB and RAM capacity of 2 GB. According to the industry technology for IC smartphones, up to 6 stacked dies can be integrated in a single package to optimize density and performance. In the modeling, the area of wafer/die is assumed to be ~5.5 cm2 to represent total wafer logic area according to the literature.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
